			<string name="help0" value="#e[How to Participate in this Event]#n\n\n  There will be a notice popping up, written in #b#eBlue#n#. When that happens, click on #e[Jean]#n and click on #e[Alright, let's go.]#n to enter.\n If you have already clicked on [Jean] before the notice popped up, all you need to do is click on [Alright, let's go.] to enter.\n\n  Please check the Event notice first before entering the event.\n  Once the event notice is up, we'll be gathering up the event participants on a #eFirst-come, First-serve#n order.\n\n  You may not participate in more than ONE event for every 24 hrs.\n  You won't be able to participate in this event if you do not have the necessary free spots available for 'Participation Reward', so please make sure to leave a free etc. slot open before joining the event.\n  If you possess the Scroll of Darkness, then you'll need to throw it away before participating.\n\n#r  During the event, if you happen to change the channel or use the Cash Shop while at the Event map, you won't be able to return to the event, thereby getting disqualified from the event, so please be careful on that."/>
			<string name="help1" value="#e[ Monster Attack ]#n\n\n#e#rA BIG MONSTER ALERT!!!#k#n\n\n A force of evil that had been sealed up for ages have recently been let loose, and the evil monsters that have soaked up the force are planning to attack any town of their choice! This is when we all need to gather up and unite as one in defeating the monsters that may endanger the lives of mnay in the area. \nThese monsters are controlled by the force of evil, and are all very powerful.\n\nThe #e#bForce of Evil#k#n that can be collected by defeating all the monsters attacking the village should be taken to the #e#bMaple Administrator#k#n.\nAfter sealing up the monstrous force through spells, the #e#bforce of evil#k#n can then be taken to #e#bNPC The Rememberer#k#n.\nAlright, now please head over to the town where the monsters have attacked, and please save the town from getting totally demolished by these evil monsters!"/>
		</imgdir>
